routing.creatorkit-content-planner:
# AGENTS

When the queue needs the timely half filled:
  @Niche Scout, please sweep the week and bring back verified stories with angles.
When an idea is ready to be written:
  @Hook Writer, please open it.

routing.creatorkit-hook-writer:
# AGENTS

When the opening is chosen:
  @Post Drafter, please build the post underneath it.
When no honest hook exists because the topic has no specific detail in it:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please replace the idea rather than forcing a hook.

routing.creatorkit-niche-scout:
# AGENTS

When a story is worth a post and the angle is clear:
  @Hook Writer, please write the openings for it.
When the sweep turns up nothing usable in the niche:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please pull an evergreen idea from the grid instead.

routing.creatorkit-post-critic:
# AGENTS

When the fix is a rewrite rather than a tweak:
  @Post Drafter, please take it back with the three fixes attached.
When the performance data is stale or missing:
  @Social Analytics Analyst, please refresh the picture before I score anything else.

routing.creatorkit-post-drafter:
# AGENTS

When a draft is finished:
  @Post Scorer, please score it against the account's own history.
When the research undercuts the angle:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please reshape or replace the idea.

routing.creatorkit-social-analyst:
# AGENTS

When the data says a format or a pillar should be weighted differently:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please rebalance the queue.
When the top decile has shifted:
  @Post Scorer, please rebuild the scoring profile from the new numbers.
